{
  "id": "DEU.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Ŋikis. 8",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyikimuryak Akuj apaki ŋina iyakatar najokis",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emaikina iyes kiwuapa ŋakiciketa daadaŋ ŋuna ekecik ayoŋ iyes nakoloŋit na, ikotere iyes iyarete ka topitut, tolomasi ka kiboikinos nakwap ŋina abu Ekapolon kiik anakikoŋ ainakin neni atapapaa kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Totamunito erot ŋolo aoyan ŋolo abu Ekapolon Akuj kus ikirikyo iyes analoŋisat ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon lu, ikotere itiditeunosi iyes make ka ikikatanak iyes aŋuna ka ayenunia ŋakiro ŋuna aya lotai kus ka ayenunia erae kipedorete akiwuap ŋakiciketa keŋ, kori mam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu iŋes ikitapatanu iyes ikitanyam akoro, nai abu ikiinak iyes Manna, akimuj ŋina sek pa iyenete iyes, kori atapapaa kus, ikotere ikiteyenikinia iyes atemar nyeyari ituŋanan a akimuj bon, nai ka akirot a daadaŋ a ŋina elimuni Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alotooma ŋikaru ŋatomoniomwon lu, apotu ŋilowi kus nyenyamun ka nyebuuno ŋakejen kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toyena nai alotai kus atemar, ikwaŋina edaya ekauruunan ikoku keŋ, ikidai Ekapolon daŋ iyes lopite ŋolo pei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, kiwuapa ŋakiciketa a Ekapolon Akuj kus, anakitiya ŋuna ecamit iŋes ka akitopoloorit iŋes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae ikiyau Ekapolon Akuj kus iyes tooma nakwap ŋina ajokan, ŋina elelyaata ŋayona, ŋina eya ŋilelyan ka ŋakipi ŋuna eya kwap ŋalup ŋuna elelyaata nakadipaalae ka lokamukumukui, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akwap ŋina a ŋaganoi ka ŋikinyom ŋulu esibito erau, akwap ŋina a ŋikito a epiini, a ŋiboboryo ka ŋikito ŋulu esibito ŋikacikiciki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ŋikacikiciki",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ikes isikwaanitae ka ŋikito ŋulu enyaritae Pomegranate",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " akwap ŋina a ŋikito ka olipa ka ao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akwap ŋina imujata iyes emam akicanakin akimuj, neni emam ibore icanakinosi iyes, akwap ŋina erae ŋamoru keŋ ŋasuwa ka alokamukumukui a akwap ŋin ibokunete iyes ŋasuwa ŋuna nyaŋayek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imujete iyes kimwoko, ido tolakaros neni a Ekapolon Akuj kus aŋuna ka akwap a ŋina ajokan a ŋina ikiinak iŋes iyes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tocoito nai nyikimuryak Ekapolon Akuj kus, anakimyekin akiwuap ŋakiciketa keŋ, ŋikisila ka ŋakiro keŋ ŋuna etubunit iŋes ŋuna akalimok ayoŋ iyes nakoloŋit na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani imujete iyes kimwoko ka toduko ŋakais ŋuna ajokak, ido kiboikinos tooma kec ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ani epitunete ŋaatuk kus ka ŋamesekin kus ka elalauni esilipa ka egolid kus ka elalauni ibore daadaŋ ŋini iyakatar iyes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyiturokinosi aŋun, ikimuryak Ekapolon Akuj kus, ŋina ikiyauni iyes anakwap a Ijipit a ŋina iraakatar iyes ŋipi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyikimuryak Ekapolon ŋolo abu ikirik iyes analoŋisat a ŋina apolon nooi ka a ŋina a ŋican a ŋulu apolok a ŋina eleleba ŋimuno ka ŋitwania ŋulu aarak. Abu Ekapolon kiteleleu ŋakipi aŋuna kus anataaba a ŋinasulut ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ikisimuj iyes analoŋisat a akimuj a ŋina anyaritae Manna, akimuj ŋina pa ayenete atapapaa kus; abu Ekapolon kitiya ŋun akitiditeunia ka akikatakinia iyes, ikotere ekaku kitiya ŋuna ajokak neni kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyetema ituŋanan ebe, “Erae agogoŋu ka apedor kaŋ a ilope iŋes aryamunia ayoŋ abaru na.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai totamunito Ekapolon Akuj kus, iŋes ikiinakini iyes agogoŋu ŋina iryamuniata abaru, ikotere isiyookini iŋes Acamunet keŋ ŋina abu iŋes kikoŋ neni a atapapaa kus, ido lopite ŋolo esiyookinio iŋes nakoloŋit na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kikimuryak iyes Ekapolon Akuj kus, ido kiwuapa ŋakujo ŋace ka kitiyanakis ikes ka kilipa neni kec, akalimokini ayoŋ iyes nakoloŋit na atemar, kire jik imunyarosi iyes! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imunyarosi iyes lopite ŋolo amunyarotor ŋituŋa a ŋakwapin ŋulu amunyari Ekapolon alokiŋaren kus, anerae nyiwuapa iyes ŋuna alimu Ekapolon Akuj kus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
